From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jiaxun Yang <jiaxun.yang@flygoat.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 09:58:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] target/loongarch: Implement semihosting support

Wire up ARM_COMPATIBLE_SEMIHOSTING for LoongArch.

The semihosting ABI (i.e. "dbcl 0xab" for semihosting call and Arm
compatible settings) is confirmed by LA132 (1C103)'s OpenOCD
implementation.

Signed-off-by: Jiaxun Yang <jiaxun.yang@flygoat.com>
---
 configs/targets/loongarch64-linux-user.mak    |  2 +
 linux-user/loongarch64/cpu_loop.c             |  5 +++
 linux-user/qemu.h                             |  2 +-
 qemu-options.hx                               | 11 ++---
 target/loongarch/Kconfig                      |  1 +
 target/loongarch/common-semi-target.c         | 44 +++++++++++++++++++
 target/loongarch/cpu.h                        |  3 ++
 target/loongarch/meson.build                  |  2 +
 .../tcg/insn_trans/trans_privileged.c.inc     | 41 +++++++++--------
 target/loongarch/tcg/tcg_cpu.c                |  6 +++
 target/loongarch/tcg/translate.c              |  1 +
 11 files changed, 93 insertions(+), 25 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 target/loongarch/common-semi-target.c

diff --git a/configs/targets/loongarch64-linux-user.mak b/configs/targets/loongarch64-linux-user.mak
